        <mxCell id="app_agent" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px;color:#1F2937&quot;&gt;green-screen-agent-app&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#4B5563&quot;&gt;.NET 10 · ASP.NET Core · 0.5 vCPU / 1 GiB · 1 replica&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Web UI + &lt;span style=&quot;font-family:Courier New;font-size:12px;color:#1F2937&quot;&gt;POST /api/run&lt;/span&gt; (one step per call)&lt;br&gt;• Creates the Foundry prompt agent at startup&lt;br&gt;• Calls Foundry as the managed identity&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#146C2E&quot;&gt;Ingress: public HTTPS → 8080&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=62;spacingTop=8;spacingRight=10;spacingBottom=6;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="env">
