        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13px;color:#1F2937&quot;&gt;Design notes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Terminal primitives only.&lt;/b&gt; No application API: the agent reads the 3270 screen buffer, types into fields, presses AID keys and checks the next screen.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;One TN3270 session&lt;/b&gt; per live server, shared by the UI, MCP clients and the operator, so it runs as one replica.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Passwords never reach the model:&lt;/b&gt; type_credential types them into hidden fields.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Foundry runs the MCP calls&lt;/b&gt;, so /mcp must be reachable from Azure; failures return as ERROR: text the model can recover from.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;No authentication&lt;/b&gt; on the live UI, /mcp and the agent app (demo): restrict before wider use.&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Same path everywhere:&lt;/b&gt; the bundled simulator, TK5 and a real mainframe are driven identically over TN3270." style="rounded=1;arcSize=3;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEA;strokeColor=#E0C060;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;spacingTop=8;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1F2937;" vertex="1" parent="rg">
